     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Seems to be a bug in ggvis. The plot shows when you remove the dot in &quot;test.ggvis&quot;.<br><br>在 2015年1月30日星期五 UTC+8下午5:41:54，Jane Yang写道：</div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><p style=\"font-size:15px;clear:both;font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;line-height:19.5px\">Hi all,</p><p style=\"font-size:15px;clear:both;font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;line-height:19.5px\"><br></p><p style=\"font-size:15px;clear:both;font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;line-height:19.5px\">I am trying to create a map using ggvis that interactively updates the fill attribute based on a Shiny input value. However, I am running into three issues:</p><ol style=\"margin:0px 0px 1em 30px;padding:0px;border:0px;font-size:15px;font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;line-height:19.5px\"><li style=\"margin:0px 0px 0.5em;padding:0px;border:0px;word-wrap:break-word\"><strong>Integrating ggvis into Shiny:</strong> For whatever reason, the ggvis will not show up when I run the Shiny app, though outside of Shiny app, it displays just fine. In case it is relevant, I am using RStudio on a Mac running OS Yosemite 10.10.</li><li style=\"margin:0px 0px 0.5em;padding:0px;border:0px;word-wrap:break-word\"><strong>Changing fill attribute without redrawing paths:</strong> I would like to dynamically change the fill attribute of polygons based on an input value, without re-drawing the paths themselves. This approach is an attempt to reduce running time as I&#39;m mapping 1450 political units and it takes a while to create the base layer.</li><li style=\"margin:0px 0px 0.5em;padding:0px;border:0px;word-wrap:break-word\"><strong>Changing legend values:</strong> The fills are based on a categorical value that essentially cuts a continuous variable (again, to try to reduce running time). I want to customize the color palette as well, but am having trouble using either the parameters in scale_ordinal or add_legend to change the display values of the legend. Instead of labeling each category, I only want to label a string for the first and last as &quot;Low&quot; and &quot;High&quot; respectively.</li></ol><p style=\"font-size:15px;clear:both;font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;line-height:19.5px\">For a reproducible code example, please see below (also attached). Thanks in advance for helping a Shiny/ggvis newbie!</p><p style=\"font-size:15px;clear:both;font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;line-height:19.5px\">Jane</p><p style=\"font-size:15px;clear:both;font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;line-height:19.5px\"><b><u>SERVER.R</u></b></p><p style=\"clear:both\"><font face=\"Helvetica Neue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:19.5px\"># libraries</span></font></p><p style=\"clear:both\"><font face=\"Helvetica Neue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:19.5px\">    suppressMessages(library(dplyr))</span></font></p><p style=\"clear:both\"><font face=\"Helvetica Neue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:19.5px\">    suppressMessages(library(ggvis))</span></font></p><p style=\"clear:both\"><font face=\"Helvetica Neue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:19.5px\">    library(shiny)</span></font></p><p style=\"clear:both\"><font face=\"Helvetica Neue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:19.5px\">    library(RColorBrewer)</span></font></p><p style=\"clear:both\"><font face=\"Helvetica Neue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:19.5px\">    </span></font></p><p style=\"clear:both\"><font face=\"Helvetica Neue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:19.5px\">    # create dummy data</span></font></p><p style=\"clear:both\"><font face=\"Helvetica Neue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:19.5px\">    base.long &lt;- c(0, 1, 1, 0)</span></font></p><p style=\"clear:both\"><font face=\"Helvetica Neue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:19.5px\">    base.lat &lt;- c(0, 0, 1, 1)</span></font></p><p style=\"clear:both\"><font face=\"Helvetica Neue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:19.5px\">    test &lt;- data.frame(long = rep(c(base.long, base.long + 1), 3),</span></font></p><p style=\"clear:both\"><font face=\"Helvetica Neue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:19.5px\">        lat = c(rep(base.lat, 2), rep(base.lat + 1, 2), rep(base.lat + 2, 2)),</span></font></p><p style=\"clear:both\"><font face=\"Helvetica Neue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:19.5px\">        order = rep(1:4, 6), group = rep(seq(1:6), 4)[order(rep(seq(1:6), 4))], </span></font></p><p style=\"clear:both\"><font face=\"Helvetica Neue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:19.5px\">        var = rep(seq(5, 30, 5), 4)[order(rep(seq(5, 30, 5), 4))])</span></font></p><p style=\"clear:both\"><font face=\"Helvetica Neue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:19.5px\">    </span></font></p><p style=\"clear:both\"><font face=\"Helvetica Neue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:19.5px\">    # define color palette</span></font></p><p style=\"clear:both\"><font face=\"Helvetica Neue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:19.5px\">    spectrum &lt;- colorRampPalette(brewer.pal(n = 4, name=&quot;YlGn&quot;))</span></font></p><p style=\"clear:both\"><font face=\"Helvetica Neue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:19.5px\">    </span></font></p><p style=\"clear:both\"><font face=\"Helvetica Neue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:19.5px\">    shinyServer(function(input, output) {</span></font></p><p style=\"clear:both\"><font face=\"Helvetica Neue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:19.5px\">        # determine fill color based on variable </span></font></p><p style=\"clear:both\"><font face=\"Helvetica Neue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:19.5px\">        toplot &lt;- reactive({</span></font></p><p style=\"clear:both\"><font face=\"Helvetica Neue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:19.5px\">            test$fill.col &lt;- as.character(cut(test$var, seq(10, 30, 5), </span></font></p><p style=\"clear:both\"><font face=\"Helvetica Neue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:19.5px\">            include.lowest = T, labels = spectrum(4)))</span></font></p><p style=\"clear:both\"><font face=\"Helvetica Neue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:19.5px\">            test$fill.col &lt;- ifelse(<a href=\"http://is.na\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://is.na&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792484774656000&amp;usg=AOvVaw15OI5DmKSKM4MYFeB_JpuY\">is.na</a>(test$fill.col) | </span></font></p><p style=\"clear:both\"><font face=\"Helvetica Neue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:19.5px\">                    test$var &lt; input$range[1] | test$var &gt; input$range[2], </span></font></p><p style=\"clear:both\"><font face=\"Helvetica Neue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:19.5px\">                &quot;#FFFFFF&quot;, test$fill.col)</span></font></p><p style=\"clear:both\"><font face=\"Helvetica Neue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:19.5px\">            return(test)</span></font></p><p style=\"clear:both\"><font face=\"Helvetica Neue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:19.5px\">        })</span></font></p><p style=\"clear:both\"><font face=\"Helvetica Neue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:19.5px\">        </span></font></p><p style=\"clear:both\"><font face=\"Helvetica Neue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:19.5px\">        toplot %&gt;% </span></font></p><p style=\"clear:both\"><font face=\"Helvetica Neue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:19.5px\">            group_by(group) %&gt;%</span></font></p><p style=\"clear:both\"><font face=\"Helvetica Neue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:19.5px\">            ggvis(x = ~long, y = ~lat) %&gt;%</span></font></p><p style=\"clear:both\"><font face=\"Helvetica Neue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:19.5px\">            layer_paths(fill = ~fill.col) %&gt;%</span></font></p><p style=\"clear:both\"><font face=\"Helvetica Neue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:19.5px\">            scale_ordinal(&quot;fill&quot;, range = c(&quot;#FFFFFF&quot;, spectrum(4)),</span></font></p><p style=\"clear:both\"><font face=\"Helvetica Neue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:19.5px\">                label = &quot;Variable Value&quot;) %&gt;%</span></font></p><p style=\"clear:both\"><font face=\"Helvetica Neue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:19.5px\">            set_options(width = 400, height = 600, keep_aspect = T) %&gt;%</span></font></p><p style=\"clear:both\"><font face=\"Helvetica Neue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:19.5px\">            bind_shiny(&quot;test.ggvis&quot;)</span></font></p><p style=\"clear:both\"></p><p style=\"clear:both\"><font face=\"Helvetica Neue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:19.5px\">    })</span></font></p><p style=\"clear:both\"><font face=\"Helvetica Neue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:19.5px\"><br></span></font></p><p style=\"clear:both\"><font face=\"Helvetica Neue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:19.5px\"><b><u>UI.R</u></b></span></font></p><p style=\"clear:both\"><font face=\"Helvetica Neue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:19.5px\">    suppressMessages(library(&quot;ggvis&quot;))</span></font></p><p style=\"clear:both\"><font face=\"Helvetica Neue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:19.5px\">    </span></font></p><p style=\"clear:both\"><font face=\"Helvetica Neue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:19.5px\">    shinyUI(fluidPage(</span></font></p><p style=\"clear:both\"><font face=\"Helvetica Neue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:19.5px\">            sidebarLayout(</span></font></p><p style=\"clear:both\"><font face=\"Helvetica Neue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:19.5px\">                sidebarPanel(</span></font></p><p style=\"clear:both\"><font face=\"Helvetica Neue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:19.5px\">                    sliderInput(&quot;range&quot;, label = &quot;Filter Range&quot;,</span></font></p><p style=\"clear:both\"><font face=\"Helvetica Neue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:19.5px\">                        min = 5, max = 30, step = 5, value = c(5, 25))</span></font></p><p style=\"clear:both\"><font face=\"Helvetica Neue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:19.5px\">                ),</span></font></p><p style=\"clear:both\"><font face=\"Helvetica Neue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:19.5px\">            mainPanel(ggvisOutput(&quot;test.ggvis&quot;))</span></font></p><p style=\"clear:both\"><font face=\"Helvetica Neue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:19.5px\">    #         mainPanel(uiOutput(&quot;test.ui&quot;), ggvisOutput(&quot;test.ggvis&quot;))</span></font></p><p style=\"clear:both\"><font face=\"Helvetica Neue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:19.5px\">        )</span></font></p><p style=\"clear:both\"></p><p style=\"clear:both\"><font face=\"Helvetica Neue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:19.5px\">    ))</span></font></p></div></blockquote></div>"
